@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 启动完整混合检索加重排序评测；仅 dev/test Profile 注册
# @name startEvaluation
POST {{baseUrl}}/retrieval-evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "HYBRID_RERANK",
  "caseIds": []
}

> {% client.global.set("evaluationRunId", response.body.data.evaluationRunId); %}

### 查询进度、五项指标、可靠性诊断和失败用例；结果仅保存在当前进程内存
GET {{baseUrl}}/retrieval-evaluations/{{evaluationRunId}}
Accept: application/json

### 只运行精确词用例，便于局部排障
POST {{baseUrl}}/retrieval-evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "BM25_ONLY",
  "caseIds": ["EXACT-001", "EXACT-002", "EXACT-003"]
}
